WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.216 --> 00:00:03.367
John, you have spent a lot of time with Kit Harington.

2
00:00:03.367 --> 00:00:06.685
I think he's the only cast member I have not personally met.

3
00:00:06.685 --> 00:00:08.715
Is he as good looking in person

4
00:00:08.715 --> 00:00:10.914
as he appears on television.

5
00:00:10.914 --> 00:00:11.747
(audience whooping)

6
00:00:11.747 --> 00:00:13.136
Oh God, this guy--
What?

7
00:00:13.136 --> 00:00:16.181
This guy, I mean,
(laughing)

8
00:00:16.181 --> 00:00:18.776
seeing him on screen is nice enough, right?

9
00:00:18.776 --> 00:00:19.609
[Conan] Yeah.

10
00:00:19.609 --> 00:00:20.442
It's nothing compared to what

11
00:00:20.442 --> 00:00:22.550
I'm gonna call the live experience.

12
00:00:22.550 --> 00:00:23.640
(audience laughs)

13
00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:24.505
It's nothing like it.

14
00:00:24.505 --> 00:00:26.976
It's a bit like only every seeing

15
00:00:26.976 --> 00:00:30.073
the Mona Lisa as a jpeg on somebody's phone.

16
00:00:30.073 --> 00:00:32.781
(laughing)

17
00:00:32.781 --> 00:00:34.029
Somebody says, "What do you think of that?"

18
00:00:34.029 --> 00:00:35.442
You go, "Yeah, it's a pretty good painting.

19
00:00:35.442 --> 00:00:37.144
"I'm not blown away by it."

20
00:00:37.144 --> 00:00:39.281
But you see it in real life, and you're like, "Good Lord."

21
00:00:39.281 --> 00:00:41.476
[Conan] Yeah. (laughs)

22
00:00:41.476 --> 00:00:44.309
(audience cheers)

23
00:00:45.323 --> 00:00:47.416
But the thing about him that's so frustrating

24
00:00:47.416 --> 00:00:50.299
is he's a man of absolutely no compromise either.

25
00:00:50.299 --> 00:00:53.697
There's a selfie of us that I put on my Instagram

26
00:00:53.697 --> 00:00:54.941
where we're both kinda leanin' in,

27
00:00:54.941 --> 00:00:56.414
and I'm doing puppy dog,

28
00:00:56.414 --> 00:00:59.070
because it's kind of all I've got, right?

29
00:00:59.070 --> 00:01:01.903
So, I'm doing puppy dog like this.

30
00:01:04.151 --> 00:01:04.984
(audience cheers)

31
00:01:04.984 --> 00:01:05.817
Oh ho.

32
00:01:06.953 --> 00:01:08.385
Gonna do more puppy dog.

33
00:01:08.385 --> 00:01:09.919
And then I say, "Right, cheers mate, thanks for that."

34
00:01:09.919 --> 00:01:12.146
And I look at it, and he's doing puppy dog as well.

35
00:01:12.146 --> 00:01:13.962
I'm like don't do puppy dog as well.

36
00:01:13.962 --> 00:01:16.350
I wouldn't do puppy dog if I had those abs.

37
00:01:16.350 --> 00:01:17.283
(laughing)

38
00:01:17.283 --> 00:01:19.415
Stay away from my schtick.

39
00:01:19.415 --> 00:01:22.557
You can't have abs and puppy dog.

40
00:01:22.557 --> 00:01:24.130
You've gotta make a choice,

41
00:01:24.130 --> 00:01:26.255
otherwise it just looks like greed.

42
00:01:26.255 --> 00:01:27.913
Yeah, he got a double dose at the factory, yeah.

43
00:01:27.913 --> 00:01:28.774
He's got a double dose of all the good stuff.

44
00:01:28.774 --> 00:01:31.538
He's right in the sweet spot between good lookin',

45
00:01:31.538 --> 00:01:33.871
vulnerable, smart, talented.

46
00:01:34.854 --> 00:01:36.562
[Conan] Yeah, you seem bitter about this.

47
00:01:36.562 --> 00:01:38.626
No, no, no, no.
(laughing)

48
00:01:38.626 --> 00:01:42.043
I just wish he'd leave me with one thing.

